          "text": "All three lists came back in full, with no paging or cut-off. The one gap: no region is marked as international. Instead, the international tours simply have no home region.\n\n**Tours (50)**\n- International, men's and women's: Championship Tour, Challenger Series, International Qualifying Series and World Longboard Tour.\n- Regional, men's and women's in each of the 7 regions: Qualifying Series, Longboard Qualifying Series and Pro Junior Series.\n\n**Regions (7):** Africa, Asia, Australia/Oceania, Europe, Hawaii/Tahiti Nui, North America and South America.\n\n**Locations (69)**\n- **Africa:** Ain Diab (Casablanca), Anchor Point (Taghazout), East Beach (Port Alfred), New Pier (Durban), Supertubes (Jeffreys Bay), Victoria Bay (George), Willard Beach (Ballito)\n- **Asia:** Akabane Beach (Tahara), Cloud 9 (Siargao), Jinzun Harbor (Taitung), Kisakihama (Miyazaki), Mahabalipuram, Nakatajima Beach (Hamamatsu), Riyue Bay (Hainan), Sabang Beach (Baler), Siheung Wave Park, Surf Abu Dhabi, Ujung Bocur (Krui)\n- **Australia/Oceania:** Bells Beach, Burleigh Heads, Cape Woolamai, Cloudbreak (Fiji), Duranbah, Fitzroy Beach (New Plymouth), Lennox Point, Manly, Manu Bay (Raglan), Merewether, Newcastle Beach, Noosa Heads, North Narrabeen, Snapper Rocks, Surfers Point (Margaret River)\n- **Europe:** Costa da Caparica, Fistral Beach (Newquay), Lacanau Océan, La Piste (Capbreton), Leça da Palmeira, Pantín, Praia da Fragata (Ferrol), Praia de Razo (Carballo), Ribeira d'Ilhas (Ericeira), Supertubos (Peniche), The Peak (Bundoran)\n- **Hawaii/Tahiti Nui:** Ala Moana Bowls, Banzai Pipeline, Haleiwa Ali'i Beach Park, Sunset Beach, Papara, Rangiroa, Taapuna, Teahupo'o\n- **North America:** 1st Street Jetty (Virginia Beach), Huntington Beach Pier, La Marginal (Puerto Rico), Lower Trestles, Pismo Beach Pier, Punta Roca (El Salvador), Soup Bowl (Barbados)\n- **South America:** El Gringo (Arica), Itamambuca (Ubatuba), Itaúna (Saquarema), Joaquina (Florianópolis), Maresias, Ponta Negra (Natal), Praia da Taíba, Praia da Vila (Imbituba), Señoritas (Punta Hermosa)",
